{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026pbh9kA4ZVG1794405888.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>灣仔錫克教廟慶祝傳統節慶，廟宇外牆掛滿燈飾，吸引不少市民到場拍照。</p><p></p><p>位於皇后大道東的錫克教廟，原本白色外牆，掛滿藍色燈泡，在周邊建築及車來車往的道路，顯得格外鮮明。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SIKHISM-2200_004.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026tDFTVYSd4Y1794405898.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>不少市民擠滿對出行人路，為求拍下這個夢幻場景。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SIKHISM-2200.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026b5dKe85nL91794405915.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>燈泡每晚約六時半至九時半亮起。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SIKHISM-2200_006.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265Nqzgkt4O01794406294.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>錫克教廟代表指，掛滿燈飾是慶祝傳統節日囚徒解放日，與坊間所指的印度教排燈節不同，但兩者都以燈飾，象徵光明戰勝黑暗。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SIKHISM-2200_005.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026xiq0j2Do2v1794406007.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SIKHISM-2200_008.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026aZspHZzQ8T1794406313.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T14:59:54.472946+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":6,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T13:59:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T12:37:14.227264+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T14:53:16.702591+00:00","content_hash":"ae84ca162eb532f7f1d0f37998c3e7a8b56f51ba8bd2bc2f4365ee904d42acc0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T14:59:54.472946+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}